        "Description": "Part 1 of the Grand Turbulence\rLet me be clear, 47. The Rising Arsonist Sly Enterprise Liberators (RASEL) have revealed critical portions of themselves to the ICA. I&apos;ve tracked down several of these bounty hunters to Paris, France, where these three will use the shadows of IAGO in order to engage in an illict tradeoff that will take place in the next 24 hours. It is paramount that you crack down on this team of anarchists, otherwise who knows what they will accelerate to. See you next week.",
